---
import LegalPage from '../components/LegalPage.astro';

const bodyHtml = `
<h2>Scope</h2>
<p>
  This policy describes how Kallus Strategic Management ("KSM", "we") handles information collected
  through this website. It does not describe the separate, more detailed handling that applies to
  information collected during a paid engagement, which is governed by the engagement agreement.
</p>

<h2>What this website collects</h2>
<p>The profile request form on this site collects only:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Whether you are enquiring as an individual or a business owner</li>
  <li>What you are trying to accomplish, and your timeline</li>
  <li>What you have identified as your main pressure points</li>
  <li>Optional free-text context you choose to provide</li>
  <li>Your first name, last name, email address and, optionally, a phone number</li>
</ul>
<p>
  The form <strong>does not</strong> ask for and should not be used to send account numbers, balances,
  Social Security numbers, tax identification numbers, dates of birth, credentials, or any other
  sensitive financial or identifying information.
</p>

<h2>Technical information</h2>
<p>
  Our hosting provider processes standard request data (such as IP address, user agent and timestamp)
  in order to serve the site and protect it from abuse. We record the page a submission came from and
  the referring URL so we understand which pages generate enquiries.
</p>

<h2>How the information is used</h2>
<ul>
  <li>To respond to your enquiry and schedule a first conversation</li>
  <li>To determine whether KSM is an appropriate fit for your situation</li>
  <li>To understand, in aggregate, how the website is performing</li>
</ul>

<h2>How it is not used</h2>
<p>
  We do not sell your information. We do not share it with lenders, funders, brokers or any other
  third party for their marketing purposes. We do not use it to build advertising profiles, and we do
  not sell or trade contact lists.
</p>

<h2>Service providers</h2>
<p>
  Submissions are stored with our infrastructure provider and delivered to us by an email provider.
  These providers process the information solely to deliver those services to KSM. If we add analytics
  or scheduling tools, they will be limited to the same purposes described above.
</p>

<h2>Retention</h2>
<p>
  Enquiry records are retained for as long as they are useful for responding, for record-keeping, and
  for understanding demand — and are deleted on request. To have your enquiry deleted, email us from
  the address you submitted.
</p>

<h2>Your choices</h2>
<p>
  You may ask us what we hold about you, ask us to correct it, or ask us to delete it. Contact
  <a href="mailto:motti@kallusstrategicmanagement.com">motti@kallusstrategicmanagement.com</a>. Depending on where you live, you may
  have additional statutory rights; we will honour valid requests under applicable law.
</p>

<h2>Cookies</h2>
<p>
  This website does not set advertising or tracking cookies. The profile form stores your in-progress
  answers in your own browser's session storage so you do not lose them if you navigate backwards; that
  data never leaves your device until you submit, and it is cleared when you do.
</p>

<h2>Children</h2>
<p>This website is intended for adults and is not directed at children.</p>

<h2>Changes</h2>
<p>
  If this policy changes materially, the updated date at the top of this page will change. Continued
  use of the site after an update constitutes acceptance of the revised policy.
</p>

<h2>Contact</h2>
<p>
  Privacy questions can be sent to
  <a href="mailto:motti@kallusstrategicmanagement.com">motti@kallusstrategicmanagement.com</a>.
</p>
`;
---

<LegalPage
  metaTitle="Privacy Policy | Kallus Strategic Management"
  metaDescription="What the KSM website collects, how it is used, what it is never used for, and how to have your enquiry deleted."
  path="/privacy"
  eyebrow="Privacy"
  title="What we collect, and the much longer list of what we do not."
  lede="The profile request asks for your goal and your contact details. Nothing financial, nothing sensitive, and nothing that gets sold."
  updated="August 2026"
  bodyHtml={bodyHtml}
/>
